Maybe even unnecessary to try; I've started quite some wizmode games to
see (empirically) what traps are generated, and there were no trapdoors,
no holes, no teleporters, and no level teleporters generated. The source
code shows that trapdoors and holes are prevented to be generated if the
level cannot be dug down to the next level. If the 'noteleport' flag is
set for a level then both types of teleport traps will not be generated.
So the source code backs up the observation for the quest level. What
remains as explanation (AFAICT) is the polytrap, your original suspicion.

